Bundled third-party components
------------------------------

sniff_sight/firmware/  (esp_sdr.bin, bootloader/bootloader.bin,
                        partition_table/partition-table.bin, flash_args, version.json)
  ESP32-S3 ESP-SDR firmware binaries, build of revision
  4128c240c92d865c7d50f4457eb07e7ed585099d (2026-10-08, profile esp32s3) of
  https://github.com/zodoczi/esp-sdr, a fork of ESPARGOS/esp-sdr
  (https://github.com/ESPARGOS/esp-sdr, Florian Euchner and contributors).
  License: GPL-3.0 (as the upstream project). Corresponding source code: the
  repository and revision above. The binaries also contain Espressif ESP-IDF
  components (Apache-2.0 and others, see the ESP-IDF license files).

sniff_sight/static/flasher.js
  Web Serial flasher, ported from the z2-web-sdr flasher (ESP-SDR project).

sniff_sight/demo/sample.json, docs/demo/
  Demo sample recorded with Sniff-Sight on an isolated OpenThread test
  network; device addresses replaced by synthetic ones.